From: Cory Forsythe <cory@coryforsythe.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 16:10:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 22/24] Render immediate send feedback and a ready-for-input
 marker in the hermes-vps pane
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The [working...] indicator only rendered once the server confirmed the
turn (message.start), after the round trip had already begun, and the
pane had no visible signal that it was idle and ready for input at all.
_forward() now prints [sending...] the instant a line reaches it, before
the RPC call, and a bare ❯ renders whenever the session goes idle.
